# Drop into the project's dev shell automatically, so `uv`, `git` and the native libs the
# Python wheels link against are all on the path the moment you cd in.
#
# One-time setup:
#
#     direnv allow
#
# Everything it provides is the same as `nix develop` — this just does it for you, and
# undoes it when you leave. If you would rather not use direnv, nothing here is required:
# `./run.sh app` still works on its own.
#
# `use flake` is built into direnv 2.30+; nix-direnv is not needed, though it does make
# repeat entries faster if you have it.

watch_file flake.nix
watch_file flake.lock

use flake
